message: "If you use LunaSRIM, please cite it as below, and cite SRIM."
title: LunaSRIM
abstract: >-
  A pure Python 3 re-implementation of SRIM-2013 (TRIM Monte Carlo and
  stopping and range tables), reverse engineered to reproduce the original
  programs digit for digit.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-11"
